OL,3,GNEWSADental care offers street sex
OL,4,Aworkers 'a lifeline'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new outreach project is helping
OL,7,Fstreet sex workers access dental care,
OL,8,Fgiving them "a lifeline", according to
OL,9,Fpractitioners.
OL,11,FThe initiative, run by Gloucestershire
OL,12,Fcharity Bridge2Aid and Bristol Dental
OL,13,FSchool (BDS), aims to break down
OL,14,Fbarriers preventing women from visiting
OL,15,Fa dentist.
OL,17,FBridge2Aid chief executive Shaenna
OL,18,FLoughnane said many women had no fixed
OL,19,Faddress or income, had experienced
OL,20,Ftrauma to the face and mouth and often
OL,21,Ffelt judged when seeking care.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
