OL,3,GNEWSADental care offers street sex
OL,4,Aworkers 'a lifeline'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKaren, not her real name, who has
OL,7,Freceived treatment through the scheme,
OL,8,Fsaid: "They were so kind, they took
OL,9,Ftheir time and it felt safe."
